# OpenWrt 25.12.6 kernel module packages (apk v3) the image takes for the firewall (nftables) and its NFLOG log viewer.
# board = qualcommax/ipq60xx (installed into the GL-AX1800 image: the stock root lacks nfnetlink_log, which the
#         firewall's `log group` rules need, so the whole netfilter set comes from these pinned packages);
# virt  = armsr/armv8 (same 6.12.112 kernel release, only for the QEMU gate's test copy of the root).
# The set is the dependency closure of kmod-nft-core kmod-nft-nat kmod-nft-fib kmod-nft-offload kmod-nfnetlink-log,
# plus kmod-wireguard (the WireGuard VPN; its etc/modules.d file loads it at boot) and kmod-nft-bridge (guest Wi-Fi
# networks: the nftables bridge filter of ap-guest; depends only on kmod-nft-core) (apk adbdump depends).
# Bump = new kmods dir + sha256 lines; fetch-kmods.sh refuses anything else.
KMOD_URL_board=https://git.canutethegreat.com/api/packages/CanuteTheGreat/generic/patronus-owrt-kernel-ax1800/6.12.119-1
KMOD_URL_virt=https://git.canutethegreat.com/api/packages/CanuteTheGreat/generic/patronus-owrt-kernel-virt/6.12.119-1
KMOD_VERSION=6.12.119-r1
